#: includes/class-wc-category-donations-admin.php:630
msgid ""
"Donations recorded for orders that are cancelled, refunded, trashed or left "
"in draft are marked as cancelled and excluded from the totals above. Use the "
"button to re-scan after bulk order changes."
msgstr ""
"Las donaciones registradas de pedidos cancelados, reembolsados, eliminados o "
"en borrador se marcan como canceladas y se excluyen de los totales "
"anteriores. Usa el botón para volver a escanear tras cambios masivos de "
"pedidos."

#: includes/class-wc-category-donations-admin.php:635
msgid "Remove donations from cancelled/trashed orders"
msgstr "Eliminar donaciones de pedidos cancelados/eliminados"

